{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9f8e7d6c-5b4a-4321-8765-1029384756ab",
    "name": "Gasty Private API — SupermercadosRD (Jhon & Sol)",
    "description": "Colección End-to-End (HU-09 / GAS-9) para validar el backend privado de Gasty conectado a Supabase PostgreSQL.\n\nIncluye:\n1. GET /api/health (Salud de servidor y Supabase)\n2. GET /api/search?q=ketchup&live=true (Búsqueda en vivo en los 5 supermercados)\n3. POST /api/lists (Crear lista 'Compra de Prueba')\n4. POST /api/lists/:id/items (Agregar 4 productos reales: Arroz, Leche, Ketchup, Queso)\n5. POST /api/lists/:id/compare (Comparar canasta completa entre los 5 supermercados)\n6. POST /api/lists/:id/start-shopping (Activar Modo En el Súper)\n7. PATCH /api/lists/:id/items/:itemId (Tachar producto en pasillo y validar subtotal)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "appToken",
      "value": "gasty-jhon-sol-private-2026",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "listId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "itemId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "winningShopId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Health Check (Supabase Cloud DB)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('Supabase DB is connected and has tables', function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('ok');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.db).to.eql('connected');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.stats.tablesCount).to.be.at.least(13);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-app-token",
            "value": "{{appToken}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "health"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Live Search 5 Supermercados (Ketchup)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('Returns liveGroups across Dominican supermarkets', function () {",
              "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.liveGroups.length).to.be.above(0);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-app-token",
            "value": "{{appToken}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=ketchup&live=true&limit=6",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "search"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "q", "value": "ketchup" },
            { "key": "live", "value": "true" },
            { "key": "limit", "value": "6" }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Crear Lista 'Compra de Prueba'",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 201 Created', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "if (jsonData.id) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('listId', String(jsonData.id));",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-app-token",
            "value": "{{appToken}}",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Compra de Prueba\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/lists",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "lists"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4a. Agregar Producto 1 — Arroz Campos 10 lb",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Item 1 (Arroz) added', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "if (jsonData.items && jsonData.items.length > 0) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('itemId', String(jsonData.items[0].id));",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-app-token",
            "value": "{{appToken}}",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"rawQuery\": \"arroz campos 10 lb\",\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"addedBy\": \"Jhon\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/lists/{{listId}}/items",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "lists", "{{listId}}", "items"]
        }
      }
    },
